Package: develcoder
Title: Code And Templates To Develop R Packages
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Jesse", "Alderliesten", , "jessealderliesten@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1132-4310"))
Description:
    This package collects code and templates I use to develop R packages. The
    code makes heavy use of the R packages devtools and usethis, following the
    book 'R packages' by Hadley Wickham and Jennifer Bryan. I use `tinytest`
    instead of `testthat` for my unit tests.
